# Dev-only device-audit scratch: uitest layout dumps, screenshots and ad-hoc
# probe scripts. Produced while verifying on emulators, never shipped. Without
# these rules a single `git add -A` would sweep in ~250 such files.
# Only tools/*.ps1 is tracked here; if a real .json/.png tool asset is ever
# needed, add it with `git add -f`.
/tools/.m9/
/tools/*.json
/tools/*.png
